#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:5 48df6234416c4ff2958c3aa30a8f7c09
msgid "Multiple Radio Control Receivers"
msgstr "多路遥控接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:7 7f38d4b1d6c74e04b04faeb441f1bba7
msgid ""
"It is possible to use multiple radio control receivers in ArduPilot for "
"redundancy or hand-off between multiple transmitters."
msgstr "ArduPilot 中可以使用多个遥控接收机，以实现冗余或多个遥控器之间的切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:10
#: 425c00a04f8649cb84be44b1562f9136
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:12
#: c9ca51a92b104129af1645048f71b249
msgid ""
"This configuration only is valid for autopilots that use an IOMCU co-"
"processor. Check the product description to be sure that the autopilot "
"includes either an STMF100 or STMF103 co-processor. Usually these outputs "
"have servo/motor outputs labeled as MAIN (the co-processor) and AUX (from "
"the main cpu)."
msgstr ""
"此配置仅适用于使用 IOMCU 协处理器的飞控。请查看产品说明以确认飞控是否包含 STMF100 或 STMF103 协处理器。通常这些输出标有 "
"MAIN（协处理器）和 AUX（主 CPU）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:14
#: 076b04eb9e7e4f88aac4809878118d2b
msgid ""
"The additional receivers can be attached to any Serial Port's RX input as "
"long as they use a serial protocol. These are: SBUS, FPort, DSM, DSM2, "
"DSM-X, IBus, SUMD, and SRXL (and CRSF if the TX output of the UART is also "
"used)."
msgstr ""
"附加接收机可以连接到任意串口的 RX 输入，只要使用串行协议即可。支持的协议包括：SBUS、FPort、DSM、DSM2、DSM-X、IBus、SUMD"
" 和 SRXL（以及 CRSF，但需同时使用 UART 的 TX 输出）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:17
#: fd11b35f58f04bceaa30d631c39ed066
msgid ""
"For whichever Serial Port the receiver is attached, the ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL``"
" should be set to 23. The baud rate is ignored and auto-detected, as well as"
" the type of the receiver."
msgstr "对于接收机所连接的串口，``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 应设为 23。波特率将被忽略并自动检测，接收机类型也将自动识别。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:19
#: 7f7bf4e33ce345639de9314dbe7138a6
msgid ""
"SBUS and FPort must either be externally inverted or the SERIALx_OPTIONS be "
"set for inversion (F and H processor types only are capable of this)."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 和 FPort 必须在外部进行信号反相，或将 SERIALx_OPTIONS 设置为反相（仅 F 和 H 处理器类型支持此功能）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:21
#: 8e7ae0ea4ed441a692671be033759661
msgid "The :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 10 must be set."
msgstr "必须设置 :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 的第 10 位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:26
#: fa6842b8a3f542f58e4b4bbef2d32850
msgid "Failsafe and Changeover"
msgstr "失控保护与切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:28
#: be6b9b384c1d4ee0ada9fdbd8a4976db
msgid ""
"The autopilot will always use the receiver attached to the IOMCU's RCin, if "
"providing valid RC signals. If that receiver fails to provide valid RC "
"signals, it will then switch to the other receiver if it is outputting valid"
" RC signals. It will reverted to the first if it restarts outputting valid "
"RC signals."
msgstr ""
"飞控将始终优先使用连接到 IOMCU RCin 的接收机（如果其提供有效 RC 信号）。如果该接收机停止提供有效 RC "
"信号，则切换到另一个接收机（如果其正在输出有效 RC 信号）。如果第一个接收机恢复输出有效 RC 信号，则切换回第一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:30
#: bc751e0e986b4b9abe4f040b9b64c8e9
msgid ""
"Note that the previously calibrated ``RCx_MAX`` , ``RCx_MIN``, "
"``RCx_REVERSED``, ``RCx_DZ`` and ``RCx_TRIM`` parameters for each channel "
"will be used by the active receiver and could vary between receivers, "
"especially if different types are mixed. It is recommended that all "
"receivers be of the same manufacture and type."
msgstr ""
"请注意，每个通道之前校准的 ``RCx_MAX``、``RCx_MIN``、``RCx_REVERSED``、``RCx_DZ`` 和 "
"``RCx_TRIM`` 参数将被激活的接收机使用，不同接收机之间这些参数可能有所不同，尤其是在混用不同类型时。建议所有接收机使用相同品牌和型号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:32
#: 45b0edad79084528b39ce8981724e310
msgid ""
"lowering throttle to below :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>`  on the first "
"receiver will not force a changeover, but rather force a normal radio "
"failsafe. Only loss of RC signals from the first receiver will cause a "
"changeover."
msgstr ""
"在第一个接收机上将油门降低至 :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` "
"以下不会强制切换，而是触发正常的遥控失控保护。只有第一个接收机完全丢失 RC 信号才会触发切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:34
#: bc05e1fc013a4f8ab22cc98ab6ed5f77
msgid ""
"If all receivers become inactive (no pulses), then the normal radio failsafe"
" handling will begin."
msgstr "如果所有接收机都停止活动（无脉冲），则开始正常的遥控失控保护处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:36
#: 8cbece53050b4151895fb3544c764759
msgid ""
"It is important that all receivers be configured for no pulses for radio "
"loss failsafe for the changeovers to work properly."
msgstr "重要：所有接收机均应配置为在遥控丢失时输出无脉冲，切换功能才能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:39
#: 9cbae02773644baf9ed4d57f80027373
msgid "Inversion"
msgstr "信号反相"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:41
#: 22c6e38896db4178b3859aa85371db3c
msgid ""
"Some protocols, like SBus, require that the signal be inverted . Autopilots "
"using F7/H7 cpus have the ability to invert the RX input via its "
"``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` bitmask. Otherwise an external inverter must be used "
"between the receiver data output and the Serial Port's RX input."
msgstr ""
"某些协议（如 SBus）要求对信号进行反转。使用 F7/H7 CPU 的飞控可通过 ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` 位掩码参数在软件层面反转 "
"RX 输入；否则需要在接收机数据输出与串口 RX 输入之间接入外部反相器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:44
#: c736a00e1f294964a509ebcc4d779046
msgid "Receivers Having Telemetry/Video Transmitters Integrated"
msgstr "集成了数传/视频发射机的接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:46
#: 2f6e07f35e8a46dbb8e9f46034b9d42e
msgid ""
"Some receivers have telemetry and/or video transmitters integrated. Having "
"multiple units, operating on the same band, in the same vehicle, can cause "
"reduction of range in both units, even if using spread-spectrum techniques. "
"CRSF, FrSky, DragonLink, etc. are some examples of these types of receivers."
" Having the antennas as widely separated as possible will help, but not "
"eliminate some range reduction. Best case is to have the units operating in "
"different radio bands."
msgstr ""
"部分接收机内置了数传和/或视频发射机。在同一飞机上有多个在相同频段工作的设备，即使使用了扩频技术，也会导致两个设备的通信距离下降。CRSF、FrSky、DragonLink"
" 等都是这类接收机的典型例子。尽量拉大天线间距有所帮助，但并不能完全消除距离损失。最佳方案是让各设备工作在不同的无线电频段。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-multiple-rx.rst:48
#: dcffbd5852034fdb8bfdb368d0780a55
msgid ""
"Be sure to do range checks on the ground using the transmitter's range check"
" mode before flight testing."
msgstr "在进行飞行测试前，请务必在地面使用遥控器的测距模式进行距离检测。"
